### 1. Create a secret (the value is never returned again)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/secrets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "key": "CRM_API_TOKEN",
  "value": "sk-live-8f2c91ab4d7e",
  "description": "Uysot CRM REST token used by the debt-lookup tool"
}

### 2. List secrets (values come back masked)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/secrets
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 3. Get one secret
GET http://localhost:8080/api/secrets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. Rename without resending the value (blank value keeps the stored one)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/secrets/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "value": "",
  "description": "Uysot CRM token (rotated 2026-09-01)"
}

### 5. Replace the value
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/secrets/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "value": "sk-live-new-value"
}

### 6. Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/secrets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
